11
01:27:18,750 --> 01:27:24,750
In the Land of Blood and Honey (Bosnian: U zemlji krvi i meda) is a 2011 war drama film written, produced, and
directed by Angelina Jolie, and starring Zana Marjanović, Goran Kostić and Rade Šerbedžija.

12
01:35:15,000 --> 01:35:21,000
The film, Jolie's first commercial release as a director, depicts a
love story set against the background of the Bosnian War.

13
01:43:11,250 --> 01:43:17,250
It opened in the United States on December 23,
2011, in a limited theatrical release.

14
01:51:07,500 --> 01:51:13,500
The film explores themes of muslim, sibling relationship, bosnian
war (1992-95), united nations, woman director.

15
01:59:03,750 --> 01:59:09,750
The tone is emotional.
